1. WHAT THIS PRODUCT IS
================================================================================

Singularity AIDR is a closed-source AI agent security platform. AIDR Scan
is a sub-product of AIDR providing deep security scanning (CVE matching,
MCP risk scoring, agent workflow analysis, jailbreak evaluation).

The core engine is distributed as a signed binary. The source code is NOT
publicly available. Software Bill of Materials (SBOM) is published with
each release per the SingularityRD trust policy (https://aidr.dev/trust).

