3. DATA SOURCES
================================================================================

AIDR Scan compiles the following data sources at build time:

  data/scan/vuln_en/        AIG CVE data (English)  - Tencent Zhuque Lab
  data/scan/vuln/           AIG CVE data (Chinese)  - Tencent Zhuque Lab
  data/scan/fingerprints/   AIG HTTP fingerprints   - Tencent Zhuque Lab
  data/scan/mcp/            AIG MCP eval prompts    - Tencent Zhuque Lab
  threats/                  AIDR rule engine rules  - SingularityRD

